aria.org/Sanhedrin_19a.13"},"reference":"Sanhedrin 19a:13","assessment":"Sanhedrin explicitly locates the mourning inquiry in Beit Almin of Hutzal. The name/place and cemetery interpretations remain attributed.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sanhedrin 19a:13","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_19a.13"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1610:1:citation-05","he":[297,322],"en":[519,548],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ecclesiastes_12.5"},"reference":"Ecclesiastes 12:5","assessment":"Ecclesiastes 12:5 supplies the exact idiom for a person going to his eternal home.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ecclesiastes 12:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ecclesiastes_12.5"},"witness":"Miqra according to the Masorah"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,2,3,4],"holds":[{"raw":"קרוב לנהרדעא הביהכ\"נ וקרוב למדרש עזרא","reason":"Megillah attests the Hutzal synagogue and a synagogue in Nehardea. The claimed distance and location of Ezra’s study house need their own source.","evidence":[{"reference":"Megillah 29a:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Megillah_29a.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"raw":"י\"מ שם מקום וי\"מ בית הקברות","reason":"Keep the place-name and cemetery interpretations attributed. The exact source form in Sanhedrin is Beit Almin of Hutzal.","evidence":[{"reference":"Sanhedrin 19a:13","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin_19a.13"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"Preserve the two interpretations and the attributed geography. Direct witnesses support the legal exchange and the Hutzal synagogue.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Gittin 61a:4","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Gittin_61a.4"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Proverbs 10:25","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Proverbs_10.25"},"witness":"Miqra according to the Masorah"},{"reference"